[{"data":1,"prerenderedAt":270},["ShallowReactive",2],{"B07JcKW3fS8Qgv_nCRTLSQHPHNLP2mj1NCBr9KX-C9Q":3},{"seo":4,"slug":8,"isDarkTheme":9,"heroBackgroundColour":10,"highlightColour":12,"simpleTitle":5,"excerpt":14,"hero":15,"heroAsset":29,"location":43,"sector":44,"services":48,"introCopy":49,"storyblockAccordions":50,"storyblockAssets":60,"flexibleContent":86,"footerLinkLabel":262,"footerLinks":263},{"title":5,"description":6,"image":7},"Spencer Hart","Nick Hart arrived at Shed with a vision—his London flagship became a journey of brand evolution, from interior design to product and packaging innovation.",null,"spencer-hart",false,{"hex":11},"#FFFFFF",{"hex":13},"#1C1C1C","Translating Nick Hart’s rich and varied ‘out there’ world into the brand’s first flagship store.",{"title":16,"subtitle":17},"\u003Cp>Spencer\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>Hart\u003C/p>",{"value":18,"links":28},{"schema":19,"document":20},"dast",{"type":21,"children":22},"root",[23],{"type":24,"children":25},"paragraph",[26],{"type":27,"value":14},"span",[],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":33},900,"",1600,{"width":32,"height":34,"url":35,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":36},1056,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140004-shed_spencer_hart_07.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":37,"srcSet":38,"src":39,"width":40,"height":41,"sizes":42},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140004-shed_spencer_hart_07.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140004-shed_spencer_hart_07.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140004-shed_spencer_hart_07.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140004-shed_spencer_hart_07.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140004-shed_spencer_hart_07.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140004-shed_spencer_hart_07.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140004-shed_spencer_hart_07.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200",3200,2112,"(max-width: 3200px) 100vw, 3200px","Brook Street, London W1.     ",[45],{"slug":46,"label":47},"retail","Retail","Brand Design, Interior Design, Packaging","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Nick Hart entered the Shed studio wearing a black seer-sucker suit, shades on, carrying a giant scrapbook of ideas. This wasn&rsquo;t just a design brief, it was the start of a journey that began with Nick&rsquo;s vision for a new London flagship store and grew into brand evolution, product and packaging design. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[51,54,57],{"title":52,"copy":53},"The Challenge","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>The challenge was not to define the brief or the man, the challenge was to articulate the environment and brand for a man who is very certain of his cultural points of reference. He just couldn&rsquo;t express it in 3D. Nick Hart&rsquo;s taste at first seem eclectic but the more we spent time, the clearer the vision became. It was all about the expressing his version of the world. An exhilarating prospect.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":55,"copy":56},"The Strategy","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiNkNjcFhIbkw1SVl6bzNyemkxekVEdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjE3MDAxMzIwNDksImRhdGFUeXBlIjoic2NlbmUifQo=(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>Mixing muitple cultural &amp; geographical references together in a seamless fashion, the desired result being the ultimate men&rsquo;s emporium of cool. An &lsquo;out there&rsquo; expression referencing icons from different eras Miles,&nbsp;Bowie, Sinatra, McQueen and Warhol. It was to be a perfect mix of clean Palm Springs meets dirty Vegas.\u2028\u2028\u2028\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"title":58,"copy":59},"The Solution","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Shed realised a compelling narrative, transitioning from day through night. Spaces lit under the metaphorical hot sun of Palms Springs, the &lsquo;light&rsquo; and day of the scheme. Books, music, film, art is presented as integral parts of the experience. Customers are encouraged to browse, purchase or just chill with a martini.\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>&nbsp;\u003C/span>\u003Cbr />\u003Cspan>A whiskey den meets vintage watches, exquisite tailoring and comfortable leather banquette accommodate David Beckham, The Arctic Monkeys or the late Bowie, everyone&rsquo;s music hero.\u2028\u003C/span>\u003C/p>\n\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Credits: Video content by Spencer Hart.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",[61,73,83],{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":62},{"width":63,"height":64,"url":65,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":66},4096,2731,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140522-spencerhart_15-1.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":67,"srcSet":68,"src":69,"width":70,"height":71,"sizes":72},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140522-spencerhart_15-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140522-spencerhart_15-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140522-spencerhart_15-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140522-spencerhart_15-1.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 2094w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140522-spencerhart_15-1.jpg?dpr=1.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=2094 3141w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140522-spencerhart_15-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=2094 523w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140522-spencerhart_15-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=2094 1047w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140522-spencerhart_15-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=2094 1570w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140522-spencerh