art_13-1.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":119,"srcSet":120,"src":121,"width":40,"height":122,"sizes":42},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140871-spencerhart_13-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140871-spencerhart_13-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140871-spencerhart_13-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140871-spencerhart_13-1.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140871-spencerhart_13-1.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140871-spencerhart_13-1.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140871-spencerhart_13-1.jpg?dpr=0.75&fit=crop&w=3200 2400w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140871-spencerhart_13-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733140871-spencerhart_13-1.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200",2095,{"_modelApiKey":124,"title":125,"sideCopy":126,"mainCopy":127},"module_title_copy","From Interior to Brand","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan data-metadata=\"&lt;!--(figmeta)eyJmaWxlS2V5IjoiWGJVSFVxeUc3bjVjOHRLZjg4NzJVdyIsInBhc3RlSUQiOjc4ODc3NzM2LCJkYXRhVHlwZSI6InNjZW5lIn0K(/figmeta)--&gt;\" style=\"caret-color: #000000; color: #000000; font-style: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: auto; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; white-space: normal; widows: auto; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; text-decoration: none;\">\u003C/span>\u003Cspan>Shed re-worked the brandmark, designed the Palm Springs cologne and underwear packaging. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>A stunning, sculptured wall reminiscent of Palm Springs&rsquo; Parker Hotel cuts through the interior serving as the backbone to the space. More than just a design feature, its iconic presence influenced multiple elements of the brand development.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"_modelApiKey":113,"asset":129},{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":130},{"width":32,"height":131,"url":132,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":133},1080,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733141333-shed_spencer_hart_03.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":134,"srcSet":135,"src":136,"width":40,"height":137,"sizes":42},"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733141333-shed_spencer_hart_03.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733141333-shed_spencer_hart_03.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733141333-shed_spencer_hart_03.jpg?fit=crop&fm=webp&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733141333-shed_spencer_hart_03.jpg?dpr=0.25&fit=crop&w=3200 800w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733141333-shed_spencer_hart_03.jpg?dpr=0.5&fit=crop&w=3200 1600w,https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733141333-shed_spencer_hart_03.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200 3200w","https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733141333-shed_spencer_hart_03.jpg?fit=crop&w=3200",2160,{"_modelApiKey":124,"title":139,"sideCopy":140,"mainCopy":141},"The Vault","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Entering through a secret concealed door, the basement has all the backstage characteristics of a darker and naughtier Vegas nightclub.\u003C/span>\u003C/p>","\u003Cp>\u003Cspan>Midnight blue velvets and chocolate walnut walls resplendent with what looks like machine gun bullet holes. A whiskey den meets vintage watches, exquisite tailoring and comfortable leather banquettes. \u003C/span>\u003C/p>",{"_modelApiKey":143,"isReversed4060":84,"assets":144},"module_side_by_side_asym",[145,158],{"copy":31,"asset":146},{"isVideo":9,"videoHeight":30,"videoUrl":31,"videoWidth":32,"image":147},{"width":148,"height":149,"url":150,"alt":7,"title":7,"responsiveImage":151},870,1107,"https://www.datocms-assets.com/133654/1733150650-shed_spencer_hart_01.jpg",{"webpSrcSet":152,"srcSet":153,"src":154,"width":1